ap=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-xJ-1LWv_X4Q7kNvwG0AAYX&_nc_oc=AdpYGoSzmdyh3hnQjQRk-nPw54pXPsrk8PtRuhB37MxSLjchndJ_Dk6jdsxmARdyYL0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSO9b_mV9SYw2VA_HnAgvlQcypdXIuIhOa6eV_Yyiqg9Q&oe=6B09C7D1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "TVGlow - IPTV & More", "keywords": ["IPTV", "M3U", "TV", "EPG", "Player"], "long_description": "TVGlow plays your own IPTV source: an M3U playlist or Xtream login, or your own Plex, Jellyfin or Emby server. It does not include channels or TV subscriptions.\n\nWATCH IN THE ROOM\nA cinema-sized screen in a 3D room: a living room, an outdoor theatre, a stadium, a lodge or a dark room. Or a panel you can resize.\n\nFREE, FOR AS LONG AS YOU LIKE\nLive TV, Guide, search, movies and shows with resume, recently watched, Home rows, sports schedules, favorites and a list of your own, with one source, in 20 languages. No email or card. Add your source and you're watching in a minute.\n\nWANT MORE? ONE PREMIUM PURCHASE\nAn optional one-time purchase through the Meta Horizon Store. It unlocks player features, not TV content: Multiview screens around you, Timeshift and Replay, downloads, channel organization, filters, more sources and lists, online subtitles, and end-to-end encrypted sync. It covers up to 6 active devices in total: headsets, phones, tablets, TVs and PCs. Try Premium free for 7 days with no card.\n\nTimeshift, Replay and downloads depend on your source. Use only content you are authorized to access or download.\n\nTVGlow is a media player only. It provides no channels, playlists or other content, and is not affiliated with any IPTV provider.\nPlex and Plex Media Server are trademarks of Plex, Inc.; Jellyfin and Emby are trademarks of their respective owners. TVGlow works with these media servers but is not affiliated with, endorsed by or certified by any of their owners.", "short_description": "Your own IPTV playlist or media server on a cinema-sized screen: a living room, an outdoor theatre, a stadium, a lodge or a dark room, or a resizable panel. A clear TV guide, one click to play, and movies and shows that pick up where you left off. Free player: no in-app ads, no time limit, no sign-up.\n\nTVGlow plays your own M3U playlist, Xtream login or home media server; it does not include channels or TV subscriptions. One optional Premium purchase also covers your phone, tablet, TV and PC."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tvglow.app/privacy/meta-quest/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://tvglow.app/terms/", "publisher_name": "18228001 Canada Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://tvglow.app/support/", "website_url": "https://tvglow.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN", "fr", "hi", "es", "pt_BR", "bn", "ru", "id", "ur", "ja", "mr", "vi", "de", "te", "tr", "he", "ko", "it", "ar"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1376833518855887"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2396044211135909"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2396044211135909"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1795374360, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2396044211135909"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "136946843